---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Pricing — Open Document Spec (ODS)" activeNav="pricing">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="eyebrow">Simple by default</span><h1>Open source core. Clear path to team features.</h1><p class="lead">ODS core is free forever under Apache 2.0. Managed sync, collaboration, and enterprise controls are planned for future releases.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-3"><article class="card pricing-card"><span class="tag">Community</span><h2>Free</h2><p>Everything you need to build a local document graph.</p><div class="price">$0 <small>forever</small></div><ul class="check-list"><li>ODS specification and profiles</li><li>Native CLI and local daemon</li><li>AI skill integrations</li><li>Apache 2.0 license</li></ul><a class="button button-secondary" href="/docs/quickstart">Start free →</a></article><article class="card pricing-card featured"><span class="eyebrow">Coming soon</span><h2>Pro</h2><p>Managed workflows for teams that want shared context infrastructure.</p><div class="price">Soon <small>cloud</small></div><ul class="check-list"><li>Managed synchronization</li><li>Team collaboration</li><li>Workspace insights</li><li>Priority support</li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="/changelog">Follow the roadmap →</a></article><article class="card pricing-card"><span class="tag">Coming soon</span><h2>Enterprise</h2><p>Governance and controls for larger, compliance-minded organizations.</p><div class="price">Soon <small>team</small></div><ul class="check-list"><li>Enterprise policy controls</li><li>Private deployment options</li><li>Audit and compliance features</li><li>Team-level administration</li></ul><a class="button button-secondary" href="/privacy">Read privacy policy →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-muted"><div class="container container-narrow"><div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Why free core matters</span><h2>Your files should never be held hostage by your context layer.</h2><p class="lead">The base format remains plain text, portable, and inspectable. Future paid features can improve collaboration without taking ownership of the documents away from your team.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
